@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Index";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_UserSideLayout.cshtml";
}
<div class="container p-5" style="background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; margin-top:30px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h1 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Website Support – Keep Your Online Presence Strong</h1>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                A website can be considered the face of any organization in this age of technology. Hence, any faults may lead to a loss of important leads. A host of issues, from poor-performing pages to unsecured content, can trouble a site; however, it can be managed. Whether it's your diary fan page or a professional business website, we assist you in ensuring its seamless performance.
            </p>
            <br />
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Common Website Issues We Solve:</h2>
            <ul style="font-size: 18px; list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Do you have trouble with your website displaying quickly enough? Slow performance can be attributed to either problematic hosting or oversized files.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Do visitors get frustrated due to broken links? Capable correction of those mistakes is possible through making frequent checks and refreshing.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Do domain or hosting configurations leave you puzzled? Correctly setting up these elements is a challenge for most.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Do you have any worries over web security? Do not worry, every possible effort will be made to safeguard your details including your good name from any kind of assault.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Would you like assistance in making changes or adding new plugins? The upkeep of your website is vital not only for everyday operation but also for security.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">How TechValet Helps You:</h2>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                We ensure that your website is always in working order, easy to interact with, and protected by appropriate measures, all thanks to regular updates and optimizations.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Call to Action Section -->
<div class="cta-container" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; padding:20px">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Let’s maintain the operational endurance of your website. Reach Out For Any Technical Assistance With Your Site.</h3>
    <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #555;">Call TechValet Computer Support for fast and reliable service.</p>
    <a href="@Url.Action("Contact","Home")" style="background-color: #E48F01; color: #fff; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 18px; border: none; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 20px; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#000'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#E48F01'">
        Call Us Now
    </a>
</div>
